{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/41ca5986f3af252a308d9d45bef0f15d.avif?t=1757671422\" width=614 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/a4576bdba0c781ece0aeb1e6bbb7ef0b.poster.avif?t=1757671422\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/a4576bdba0c781ece0aeb1e6bbb7ef0b.webm?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/a4576bdba0c781ece0aeb1e6bbb7ef0b.mp4?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/32ef2f9aa97771f2c8c792daff3d0438.poster.avif?t=1757671422\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/32ef2f9aa97771f2c8c792daff3d0438.webm?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/32ef2f9aa97771f2c8c792daff3d0438.mp4?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather up to 4 friends and work together to strategically plan. Upgrade your hero\u2019s skills each day, and gather resources to upgrade a variety of weapons in preparation for the deadly nights.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/552638a10122c8b8e208304dd2338f5e.poster.avif?t=1757671422\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/552638a10122c8b8e208304dd2338f5e.webm?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/552638a10122c8b8e208304dd2338f5e.mp4?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/f6de9d27b1dc8aae54cea8026f9fe19d.poster.avif?t=1757671422\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/f6de9d27b1dc8aae54cea8026f9fe19d.webm?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/f6de9d27b1dc8aae54cea8026f9fe19d.mp4?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you have prepared enough. The night brings high-intensity survival. Blast through waves of deadly zombies and elite bosses by working together with your squad. Rely on your friends and their distinct classes: Tank DPS and Healer, and make it to another day.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/40cf09d08117c1528981d9334e4a8dcf.poster.avif?t=1757671422\" width=600 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/40cf09d08117c1528981d9334e4a8dcf.webm?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/40cf09d08117c1528981d9334e4a8dcf.mp4?t=1757671422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Scenario Mode: Explore the apocalyptic world and characters by progressing through story-driven stages with increasing difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Challenge Mode: Truly test your skills and survive as long as you can against never-ending waves of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/b0fa99f718ef167e029a1833a4b2e292.avif?t=1757671422\" width=600 height=314 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Last Squad is a work in progress. New features, such as Hero Traits and Customization, are currently in development, and these features may be subject to change in the future. <br><br>Thank you for your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600590?t=1757671422","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600590?t=1757671422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/e49aec8e65d388c567a6e826acf68415e2f8d9bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757671422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/e49aec8e65d388c567a6e826acf68415e2f8d9bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757671422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3775910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600590/extras/41ca5986f3af252a308d9d45bef0f15d.avif?t=1757671422\" width=614 height=186 /><